  "feedback": [
    "Actual GLB retains the corrected deep access shaft, two red far-wall fittings, paired rigid green covers, narrowed front brass buttresses/steps and shortened bent mast from the latest source. It does not restore the rejected shallow ribbed floor.",
    "All 45 asset mesh surfaces match the original evaluated closed geometry exactly. Two clips share one mesh/material/image payload; descriptor poses do not require fourteen standalone full-model GLBs.",
    "One imported Blender NLA strip offset was diagnosed from actual strip/action ranges: descriptor track placed at frame1 with action keys2..17. Verification samples using measured offsets native0/imported1 without altering GLB keys. Absolute glTF state times are descriptor/24 seconds; STEP interpolation prevents invented in-between poses.",
    "Twenty actual native/imported image pairs have identical alpha/threshold silhouettes. Indicator visibility/open-shaft ray tests, 61 integer cycle poses and 16 descriptor poses pass. Sampled surface intersection checks do not prove continuous/volumetric sweep; descriptor17 lower-structure/purple-shadow composition remains unverified.",
    "Concept has a more compact body and no large side-cassette fields; established side-pocket/telescopic engineering and body proportions remain an authored approximation. Do not treat numerical source preservation or render agreement as final artistic acceptance.",
    "Final budget audit: 13,170 raw pre-modifier triangles had understated the runtime budget. Evaluated native/imported geometry and actual GLB index accessors now agree at19,010. No source anatomy or mechanism change; all40actual renders and both imported-GLB previews regenerated before rebinding."
  ],
